IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate

-- Civil Liability Act 2002 (Tas) -- the dates, in one small module.
--
-- The only module that imports daydate. The other modules reach dates only through the names below.
-- "By the end of the period of 60 days after" a day (s 49P(1)(a)) and "within 28 days after" a day (s 49P(4)) exclude
-- that day (read as the plain words), so the last day of the period is the day plus 60 (or 28).
--
